    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34836" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναντί̆-βῐος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set against, hostile</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθυίαις οὔποτ᾽ ἐναντίβιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					10.8
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔποτε ἀντιβίας</span>):
			elsewh. neut. as Adv., <i>face to face, against</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαχέσασθαι, πολεμίζειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				11.8.168
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.451
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.130
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.266
				</span></i>
			: c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχιλῆος ἐ. πολεμίξειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.85
				</span></i>
			.--Only poet.</div>
